# HELP gpon_olt_info Always 1. Labels are what the OLT wrote about itself in the OMCI OLT-G entity (class 131), from `omcicli mib get 131`: vendor, version and equipment_id as text, or as hex when not printable.
# TYPE gpon_olt_info gauge
gpon_olt_info{vendor="4142ff",version="ff7632",equipment_id="4f4c542d32303022"} 1
